/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (The period from March to December 2025 covers the first full stage of operation of the BrainlyHQ server, which was created on 19 March 2025. The server is owned by the user brainlymods. The initial months were devoted to implementation, while the following months brought gradual stabilisation of activity and an increase in the number of users, which exceeded 800 by the end of the year.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (During the analysed period, an average of 6,172.4 messages per month were sent on the server, for a total of 61,724 messages. The structure of senders remained relatively constant: on average, 3,250.3 messages per month came from users, 1,957.6 from bots, and 964.5 were generated by webhooks. These data indicate the important role of automation and system integration, while maintaining a high share of end-user activity.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
