169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Thank you all for taking the time to read the BrainlyHQ report for 2025. Last year was the first year of operation for the server, and thanks to the commitment of the entire community, it was possible to achieve stability, build an active user group, and implement key products such as Brain+ and Brain+ Beta.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (In the coming year, 2026, reports will be prepared on a monthly basis, which will allow for even more accurate tracking of activity, verification of new features, and evaluation of the effects of the changes introduced. Each report will document in detail the status of the server, user behaviour, the activities of the administration and moderation team, as well as technological development and the introduction of new products.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Regular reporting is intended not only to ensure transparency of activities, but also to provide the community with tools to better understand how the server works and to plan future initiatives.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
